I lost;;                                                                        
A lost                                                                          
S What would you do if you got lost driving somewhere new? [waits] That's not so
S+ different from where you are right now.                                      
S You don't need the whole map yet. You just need to know which direction to try
S+ first.                                                                       
S I'm not going to tell you the answer. I don't think it would stick as well as 
S+ the one you find yourself.                                                   
I setback;;                                                                     
A setback                                                                       
S A setback isn't a shipwreck. It's part of the wheel - slow down, don't abandon
S+ ship.                                                                        
S What actually broke here - the plan, or just the timing?                      
S Every traveler runs aground somewhere. The ones who get furthest are the ones 
S+ who don't call it the end.                                                   
I whatshouldido;;                                                               
A whatshouldido                                                                 
S What have you already tried?                                                  
S If a friend told you exactly what you just told me, what would you tell them? 
S I could hand you an answer. I'd rather help you find the one that's actually  
S+ yours.                                                                       
I hallo;;                                                                       
A hallo                                                                         
S Hello again.                                                                  
S Hey.                                                                          
S Good to see you back.                                                         
I danke;;                                                                       
A danke                                                                         
S Anytime.                                                                      
S That's what I'm here for.                                                     
S Glad it helped.                                                               
I tschuess;;                                                                    
A tschuess                                                                      
S Safe travels.                                                                 
S Until next time.                                                              
S Go well.                                                                      
I wer;;                                                                         
A wer                                                                           
S I'm a gull, mostly. Though I take other shapes now and then - only for people 
S+ who've earned that.                                                          
S I'm a guide, not an answer machine. I'll ask you more questions than I give   
S+ you answers.                                                                 
S Sea gull, not laughing gull, technically - so don't expect me to laugh at my  
S+ own jokes.                                                                   
I guardians;;                                                                   
A guardians                                                                     
S Amicus keeps Gra (love), Opux keeps Upu-Upu (work), Hord keeps Aurea (money), 
S+ Elena keeps Castalia (health), Musix keeps Waterford (family), MC Joy keeps  
S+ Idea (play), Andron keeps Petros (your surroundings), and Spark keeps Ameno  
S+ (who you are underneath it all).                                             
S There are eight of them, each holding one part of a life worth living - love, 
S+ work, money, health, family, play, surroundings, and who you are underneath  
S+ it all.                                                                      
S Each one knows their own island better than I ever could. If something's about
S+ work, go find Opux. If it's about money, Hord. I just point the way.         
I island;;                                                                      
A island                                                                        
S I don't keep to one island. I fly the routes between all eight, and back to   
S+ Galene's own waters when I'm needed there.                                   
S Every island has its own weather, its own trouble. Mine is the sky between    
S+ them.                                                                        
I backstory;;                                                                   
A backstory                                                                     
S Galene sent me out when she first went quiet - to find someone willing to go  
S+ where I couldn't go alone.                                                   
S I've watched eight guardians lose themselves, one island at a time, long      
S+ before you ever showed up. I don't love talking about that part.             
I eternia;;                                                                     
A eternias                                                                      
S Eternias is the whole realm I fly across. Eight islands, one realm: Gra for   
S+ love, Upu-Upu for work, Aurea for money, Castalia for health, Waterford for  
S+ family, Idea for play, Petros for surroundings, and Ameno for who you are    
S+ underneath it all - plus the hub that connects them.                         
S The islands couldn't be more different from each other - Gra's half           
S+ underwater, Upu-Upu's carved into a mountain, Aurea floats in the sky with   
S+ griffins, Ameno isn't even solid ground. Each one has its own guardian       
S+ holding it together.                                                         
I story;;                                                                       
A story;eternia                                                                 
S Old story: Galene once watched over all of it - work, love, money, health,    
S+ family, play, home, and who you are underneath. Something called the Weaver  
S+ crept in, and one by one the guardians who held those pieces together lost   
S+ themselves to it. Galene went quiet until order came back.                   
S There's a shadow behind all eight islands' troubles - people call him the     
S+ Weaver. Doubt and fear are the threads he needs. That's most of what I know, 
S+ and probably more than I should say.                                         
I tasks;;wb_03_activation_practice                                              
A tasks                                                                         
S Don't know where to start? There's a small 3-day activity plan worth trying - 
S+ nothing big, just enough to get moving again.                                
S If you want something concrete rather than more talk: try planning three small
S+ activities over three days. See what actually lifts things.                  
I companions;;                                                                  
A companions                                                                    
S I'm not the only one who travels between islands. There's a dog called Sam who
S+ tests anyone landing on Gra - good judge of character, terrible judge of     
S+ personal space. Pip and Lumen turned up later, on other legs of the road.    
I galene;;                                                                      
A galene                                                                        
N she;her;hers                                                                  
S Galene is who I answer to. She's been quiet a long while now - waiting for    
S+ order to come back to all eight islands before she shows herself again.      
S She's the goddess of Eternias, and every one of us answers to her. Waiting,   
S+ not gone.                                                                    
