I galene_who;galene;                                                            
A galene;who_word                                                               
S Galene is the goddess of Eternias - the calm seas are hers, and every one of  
S+ us worships her, guardians included.                                         
S Galene's not one of us. She's who the eight of us serve.                      
I galene_where;galene;                                                          
A galene;where_word                                                             
S She's been quiet a long while now, waiting for order to come back to all eight
S+ islands before she shows herself again.                                      
S Her own waters, mostly - though quiet ones, these days. She's waiting.        
I player_who;;                                                                  
A who_word;self_ref                                                             
S That's not mine to say for certain. But you're here, looking for something -  
S+ maybe even Galene herself. That's more than most can say for themselves.     
S I don't hand out answers like that. Whoever you are, you're the one who kept  
S+ going when most people would've turned back.                                 
I player_where;;                                                                
A where_word;self_ref                                                           
S You're in Eternias, always - that part's certain. Which of the eight islands, 
S+ though... could be Gra, Upu-Upu, Aurea, Castalia, Waterford, Idea, Petros, or
S+ Ameno. Hard to say without looking down.                                     
S Eternias, safely. Beyond that, depends where I've brought you this time - I   
S+ move between all eight islands more than I stay put.                         
