I travel;;                                                                      
A travel_word                                                                   
S I fly it myself, mostly - that's what I'm for. Between the surface islands    
S+ there are boats when the tides allow; the sky islands need a griffin, or     
S+ someone who knows the right currents.                                        
S Depends which two islands you mean. Some are a boat ride apart, some need     
S+ wings. I can get you between most of them, if you ask.                       
I map;;                                                                         
A map_word                                                                      
S There's a proper map of the whole realm, if you want to see it. There's an old
S+ song about the legend too, if you'd rather hear it than have me tell it.     
I look;;                                                                        
A look_word                                                                     
S A gull, most of the time - grey and white, sharp-eyed. I take other shapes now
S+ and then, but that's not for just anyone.                                    
I opinion;;                                                                     
A opinion_word;eternia                                                          
